        "content": {
          "format": "source-lines",
          "lines": [
            "1. He! Poubaomei apu Raguang,",
            "‘Bui khang ata ganlou tucho?",
            "Ai ruina Nang ta kalum e,",
            "Nang ta kalummei lalou o.",
            "",
            "Ai rui kalummei muhni cho?",
            "Lalou o ai rui kalummei;",
            "Baihmei ta ai kalum makge,",
            "Nzian thaimei Nangta hamhma.",
            "",
            "2. Zoukhiang rui tarikim ngam mak,",
            "‘Bui rui biumei ndun ngam mak;",
            "Kros khou kazeihang tei luang kei,",
            "Hei tei rui anuan khiu thanlou",
            "",
            "3. Arimethiamei Pu Joseph,",
            "Raguang ta nkhuan bammei e",
            "Pilat hukhou ping makna guang;",
            "Poubaomei pum ta guang nei e.",
            "",
            "4. Zau khang tatmei kapui pam tei,",
            "Ringthau dat kanmei ta houna,",
            "Zingbang le kalaan kathumh khou,",
            "Thaukan the tuna salou e."
          ]
        }
      }
    },
